Feature: Extract product size from product description and update database

  Background:
    Given the Unity Catalog Schema is "purgo_playground"
    And the input file is "product_desc (1) (1).csv"
    And the target table is "purgo_playground.d_product_revenue_bronze"

  Scenario: Extract product size from product description
    Given a product description "ALUM EXTRUDED ROUND TUBE - BAR - 1-Aluminum Bar - 6061-T6511-TB - 6061-T6511-TB-3.7500-.3750-23.7000"
    When the system extracts the product size
    Then the extracted product size should be "3.7500-.3750-23.7000"
    And the product size is saved in the database

  Scenario: Extract product size using product ID as fallback
    Given a product description "ALUMINUM EXTRUDED TUBING - BAR - 1-Aluminum Bar - 7075-T73-TB - 7075-T73-TB-2.8750"
    And a product ID "YRDMT-7075-T73-TB-2.8750"
    When the system fails to extract the product size from the description
    Then the system should use the product ID to extract the product size
    And the extracted product size should be "2.8750"
    And the product size is saved in the database

  Scenario: Add timestamp column to the database
    Given the target table is "purgo_playground.d_product_revenue_bronze"
    When the system updates the table
    Then a new column "timestamp" should be added
    And the format of the timestamp should be "yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss"

  Scenario Outline: Validate product size extraction logic
    Given a product description "<product_description>"
    And a product ID "<product_id>"
    When the system extracts the product size
    Then the extracted product size should be "<expected_product_size>"
    And the product size is saved in the database

    Examples:
      | product_description                                                                 | product_id                                | expected_product_size |
      | "ALUM EXTRUDED ROUND TUBE - BAR - 1-Aluminum Bar - 6061-T6511-TB - 6061-T6511-TB-3.7500-.3750-23.7000" | "YRDMT-6061-T6511-TB-3.7500-.3750-23.7000" | "3.7500-.3750-23.7000" |
      | "ALUMINUM EXTRUDED TUBING - BAR - 1-Aluminum Bar - 7075-T73-TB - 7075-T73-TB-2.8750" | "YRDMT-7075-T73-TB-2.8750"                 | "2.8750"               |

  Scenario: Error handling for missing product size
    Given a product description "ALUMINUM EXTRUDED TUBING - BAR - 1-Aluminum Bar - 7075-T73-TB"
    And a product ID "YRDMT-7075-T73-TB"
    When the system fails to extract the product size from both description and ID
    Then an error message "Product size extraction failed for product ID: YRDMT-7075-T73-TB" should be logged
    And the process should continue with the next record
